Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,《超人总动员》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.83,0:00:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个开了吗？ - 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this on? - That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我会穿墙破壁 却不会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can break through walls, I just can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这样 - 却不会玩这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's fine. - I can't get this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇超人… 你有保密的身份吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Incredible... Do you have a secret identity?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,每个超级英雄都有保密的身份 我还不知道有谁不是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every superhero has a secret identity. I don't know a single one who doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.05,0:00:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,谁愿意一直承担当超人的压力呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wants the pressure of being super all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.25,0:00:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然有保密的身份啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I have a secret identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:00:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为会在超市里看见我穿成这样？ 得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you see me in this at the supermarket? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,谁愿意用弹力女侠的身份去买东西 明白我的意思吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who'd want to go shopping as Elastigirl, know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.47,0:01:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那些女超人 总是想把自己的 保密身份告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superladies, they're always trying to tell you their secret identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她们觉得可以这样来套近乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think it'll strengthen the relationship or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,“姑娘 我不想知道你那温柔的另一面”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Girl, I don't want to know about your mild- mannered alter ego or anything like that."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.09,0:01:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 你告诉我你是 宇宙无敌超级霹雳小甜甜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you tell me you're a super- mega- ultra- lightning- babe,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.69,0:01:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那就行了 我很满意 很满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's all right with me. I'm good. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.80,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你多少次拯救世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter how many times you save the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,它总是又会陷入危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it always manages to get back in jeopardy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候我真想叫它消停一下 明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I just want it to stay saved, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.11,0:01:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,只要一会儿 我觉得自己像女佣一样 “我刚刚把这里收拾好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a little bit. I feel like the maid. "I just cleaned up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们就不能让它干净个十分钟吗？”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we keep it clean for ten minutes?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我能理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could get to that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- “劳驾？” - 还没结束呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Please?" - We're not finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.03,0:01:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有时我觉得我就喜欢平平淡淡 的生活 你明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I think I'd just like the simple life, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微休息一下 安心养家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax a little and raise a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,退隐江湖？ 你开玩笑吧？ 我正在兴头上呢！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Settle down? Are you kidding? I'm at the top of my game!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是跻身大人物的行列！姑娘们 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm up there with the big dogs! Girls, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:02:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,把拯救世界的工作让给男人？ 我可不同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave the saving of the world to the men? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.37,0:02:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,现在插播一条新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We interrupt for a bulletin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,警方正在飞车追捕持枪歹徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A high- speed pursuit between police and armed gunmen is underway,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们沿圣帕布洛大道向北行驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}traveling northbound on San Pablo Ave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,(单独追捕)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.69,0:02:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 我有时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I've got time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,(合作追捕 自动驾驶)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,(拦截模式 转换)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇超人 神奇超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 太太？ - 我的猫 小喳喳 不肯下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it, ma'am? - My cat, Squeaker, won't come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 建议您站远点 可能有麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly. I suggest you stand clear. There could be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不会 他很乖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's quite tame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 神奇超人 你又成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Incredible. You've done it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是最棒的 - 不 只是刚好来这儿帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're the best. - No, I'm just here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.91,0:03:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,各单位注意 发生了观光巴士抢劫案…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All units. We have a tour bus robbery...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,观光巴士抢劫案 我还有时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tour bus robbery. I've still got time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.11,0:04:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,警官 太太 小喳喳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officers. Ma'am. Squeaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 酷！准备出动！ - 这是…？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cool! Ready for take- off! - What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你到底是谁？ - 我是神奇小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you supposed to be? - I'm IncrediBoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？ 不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.63,0:04:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你是那个追星族俱乐部的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're that kid from the fan club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.93,0:04:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,布洛菲 布洛迪 巴迪！你叫巴迪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brophy. Brody. Buddy! Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫神奇小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is IncrediBoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直对你们很和气 跟你们合影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been nice, I've stood for photos,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在你们给我的每张纸上签名 可这…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}signed every scrap of paper you pushed at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.65,0:04:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 不用费心训练我 我知道你的动作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, don't worry about training me. I know your moves,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,打击犯罪的风格 最喜欢的口头禅 我全知道！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}crime fighting style, favorite catch phrases, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的头号崇拜者！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your number one fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 喂 等一下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,…看一个女人钱包里的东西 就可以对她了解许多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you can tell a lot about a woman by the contents of her purse,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这也许不是你的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but maybe that's not what you had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你瞧…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,弹力女侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elastigirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:05:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那没关系 我已经逮到他了 - 当然啦 你已经逮到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's all right. I've got him. - Sure, you've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.31,0:05:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我只不过替你制住他 - 没错 你干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I just took him out for you. - Sure, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他的注意力都在我身上 - 我利用了这一点来做我的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- His attention was on me. - A fact I exploited to do my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是说我的工作吧 - 你说声谢谢总可以吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My job, you mean. - A simple thank you will suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.32,0:05:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 可我不需要帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, but I don't need any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那“女士优先”怎么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever happened to "ladies first"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那“男女平等”又怎么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, whatever happened to equal treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 是这个小姐先逮到我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, the lady got me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 我们可以分摊 - 我是单干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, we could share, you know. - I work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那么我觉得你应该再多点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I think you need to be more...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,…弹性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...flexible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你待会儿有事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you doing anything later?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经和人约好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a previous engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 你就呆在这儿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.77,0:05:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一般会在一小时内收拾垃圾的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They usually pick up the garbage in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 神奇超人！ - 嘿 寒冰侠！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Incredible! - Hey, Frozone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还没准备好吗？ - 我还有时间呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shouldn't you be getting ready? - I still got time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他要跳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我的骨头弄断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you broke something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等你接受心理治疗后 会原谅我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With counseling, I think you'll come to forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bomb Voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.34,0:06:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还有神奇小子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And IncrediBoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.17,0:07:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇小子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}IncrediBoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想知道我为什么来得这么快吗？ 因为我穿了火箭靴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you curious about how I get around so fast? I have rocket boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回家去 巴迪 快点 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go home, Buddy. Now. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢小子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid boy

...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能谈谈吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.98,0:07:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你总说要坦诚面对你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always say be true to yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可你没说过是对哪一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you never say which part to be true to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.99,0:07:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 现在我终于想明白我是谁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've finally figured out who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的卫兵… 神奇小子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your ward... IncrediBoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,可你现在走得太远了 巴迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, you have officially carried it too far, Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我没有超能力 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is because I don't have powers, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 不是每个超级英雄都有超能力的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not every superhero has powers, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.51,0:07:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没有超能力也可以当超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can be super without them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我发明了这些东西 我能飞 你能飞吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I invented these. I can fly. Can you fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那就飞回家去 巴迪 我是单干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly home, Buddy. I work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你的那套行头可笑至极！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your outfit is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,给我一次机会就行！我会让你瞧瞧 我去找警察来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me one chance! I'll show you. I'll go get the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 巴迪 不要！ - 一会儿就行 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Buddy, don't! - It'll only take a second, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,停下！有炸弹！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, stop! There's a bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,放开 你把我的飞行模式搅乱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go, you're wrecking my flight pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要是放手我就能飞好！ - 你就不能…？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can do this if you let go! - Will you just...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是想帮你！停下！ - 别抓着我的披风！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm trying to help! Stop! - Let go of my cape!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,送这小子回家 一定要让她妈妈 知道他干的好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this one home. And make sure his mom knows what he's been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我能帮你 你是在铸成大…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can help you. You're making a mist...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那个跳楼者受伤了 你们派 医护人员了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The injured jumper. You sent paramedics?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把他带走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They picked him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大楼里的爆炸是炸弹魔干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blast in that building was caused by Bomb Voyage
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他抢劫金库时被我撞上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who I caught robbing the vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我们封锁这一带 也许能逮住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We might nab him if we set up a perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.53,0:08:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他逃掉了？ - 嗯 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He got away? - Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 都是因为这小淘气 - 是神奇小子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Skippy here made sure of that. - IncrediBoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你可没关系！糟糕 我迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not affiliated with me! Holy smokes, I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我得马上到别处去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I've gotta be somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那么炸弹魔呢？ - 以后再说 我会去抓他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about Bomb Voyage? - Any other night, I'd go after him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.05,0:09:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不过现在我真得走了 别担心 我们会逮到他的！总有一天！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I really gotta go. Don't worry. We'll get him! Eventually!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 今晚还有时间吧？ - 你迟到很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is the night still young? - You're very late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我看起来怎样？ 还行吧？ - 面具 你还戴着面具呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do I look? Good? - The mask. You still got the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏开场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特·帕尔 您愿意让这女子 成为你的合法妻子吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robert Parr, will you have this woman to be your lawful wedded wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.79,0:09:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你迟到了 你那时问我待会儿有没有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're late. When you asked if I was doing anything later,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.99,0:09:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没想到是你忘记了 我以为你是在和我开玩笑呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't realize you'd forgotten. I thought it was playful banter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的是玩笑 - 你不觉得你把时间留得太紧了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was. - Cutting it close, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要再多点… 弹性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to be more... flexible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.51,0:09:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 可要是我们想让这婚姻美满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, but if we're gonna make this work,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你就不能光顾着当神奇超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've gotta be more than Mr. Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that. Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- …只要你们二人仍然在世？ - 我愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...so long as you both shall live? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我宣布这对新人结为夫妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pronounce this couple husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们都还在世 不管发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as we both shall live. No matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 别逗了 我们是超级英雄啊 还能发生什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come on. We're superheroes. What could happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,经过一连串令人眼花缭乱的事件 一位超级英雄遭到起诉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a stunning turn of events, a superhero is being sued
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,原因是他救了显然不想被搭救的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for saving someone who, apparently, didn't want to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,原告奥利弗·桑斯维特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plaintiff, Oliver Sansweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.15,0:10:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,在企图自杀时被神奇超人阻止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was foiled in his attempted suicide by Mr. Incredible,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他向高级法院提出了针对这位 著名超级英雄的诉讼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has filed suit against the famed superhero in Superior Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,桑斯维特先生并没有呼救 他不想被人救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sansweet didn't ask to be saved. He didn't want to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.87,0:10:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,由于神奇超人的“行动”导致的伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The injury received from Mr. Incredible's "actions",
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 令他终日生活在痛苦中 - 我救了你的命！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- causes him daily pain. - I saved your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是救了我的命！你是让我求死不能！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't save my life! You ruined my death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我的当事人没有意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My client has no comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,五天以后 高架铁路事故的受害者 又提出了另一起诉讼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another suit was filed by victims of the el train accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇超人的败诉令政府付出了数百万元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredible's court losses cost the government millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.39,0:10:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,同时也引发了世界各地数十起 超级英雄诉讼案的风潮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And opened the flood gates for dozens of superhero lawsuits the world over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:11:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该让他们的保密身份 成为他们唯一的身份了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time for their secret identity to become their only identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们现在要选择是加入我们 还是离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for them to join us, or go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,迫于巨大的公众压力和没完没了的诉讼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under public pressure, and the financial burden
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,带来的巨额财政负担\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of an ever mounting series of lawsuits,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,政府悄悄启动了超级英雄重新安置案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the government quietly initiated the superhero relocation program.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,超人们以往的过失得到了特赦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The supers were granted amnesty from responsibility for past actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,作为交换条件 他们承诺 再也不充当英雄的角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in exchange for the promise to never again resume hero work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,昔日英雄今何在？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就生活在我们中间 平凡的公民 平凡的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are living among us. Average citizens, average heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,默默无闻 隐姓埋名 继续为世界作着贡献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quietly and anonymously continuing to make the world a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.85,0:11:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,拒绝？ 你拒绝我的索赔要求？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Denied? You're denying my claim?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白 我买了全保的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. I have full coverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 霍根森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Mrs. Hogenson,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们的义务在第17段已经写明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but our liability is spelled out in paragraph 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上面讲得很清楚… - 这 这个我付不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It states clearly... - I can't pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 理赔科 鲍勃·帕尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Claims, Bob Parr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我是要告诉你一个重大喜讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm calling to celebrate a momentous occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在算是正式住进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're now officially moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好啊 棒极了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, that's great, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:11:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那么过去三年不算是因为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last three years don't count because...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我终于拆开了最后一个箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I finally unpacked the last box.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.69,0:12:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是正式的了 哈哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, it's official. Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么有这么多垃圾？ - 听着 我在接待一个客户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why do we have so much junk? - Listen, I've got a client.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.90,0:12:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不用说了 拯救世界去吧 一次一张保单 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say no more. Go save the world one policy at a time, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！我该去接孩子了 晚上见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! I gotta go pick up the kids. See you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.41,0:12:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 亲爱的 不好意思 我们说到哪儿了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, honey. Excuse me. Where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我是靠固定收入过日子的 要是你不能帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on a fixed income, and if you can't help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不知道该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 听好了 我是想帮你 可我办不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, listen closely. I'd like to help you, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想告诉你拿一份保单的复印件 去找诺玛·威尔考克斯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to tell you to take a copy of your policy to Norma Wilcox on...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,诺玛·威尔考克斯 W- l- L- C- O- X 在三楼 可我办不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Norma Wilcox. W- I- L- C- O- X. On the third floor. But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会建议你填写WS2475表格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also do not advise you to fill out and file a WS2475 form
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.05,0:12:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,然后交到二楼的法律部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with our legal department on the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.46,0:12:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我估计也不会有什么人 能很快帮你解决问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't expect someone to get back to you quickly to resolve the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想帮你 但是我什么也做不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to help, but there's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.77,0:12:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 谢谢你 年轻人 - 对不起 太太 我知道你很苦恼！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, thank you, young man. - Sorry. I know you're upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.47,0:13:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,装作很苦恼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretend to be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,帕尔！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parr!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你批准了沃克那份保单的赔款！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You authorized payment on the Walker policy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.49,0:13:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哈夫先生 有人闯进了他们家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone broke into their house, Mr. Huph.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们的保单包含了… - 这个我不想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Their policy covers... - I don't wanna know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.79,0:13:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我说这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.74,0:13:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说说你是怎么 让咱们公司一直赔钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me how you're keeping lnsuricare in the black.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你怎么会给每一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me how that's possible, with you writing checks
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,给你打电话的霉运先生 和苦命小姐写支票的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to every Harry Hardluck and Sally Sobstory that gives you a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.61,0:13:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,上午休息时间结束 上午休息时间结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning break is over. Morning break is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你能来 帕尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate you coming down here, Mrs. Parr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么了？ 达什做错什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this about? Has Dash done something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他是害群之马 他公然在全班 面前嘲弄我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a disruptive influence and he openly mocks me in front of the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他说的 - 我知道是你干的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He says. - Look, I know it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在我的椅子上放图钉 - 你看见是他干的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He puts thumbtacks on my stool. - You saw him do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哦… 没有亲眼看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... not really. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.25,0:13:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.45,0:13:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那你怎么知道是他干的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, then how do you know it was him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我藏了一台摄像机 对 这一次我算是逮到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hid a camera. Yeah, and this time, I've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,看见吗？ 你们看见吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.27,0:14:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没看见？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他动了！就在那儿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He moves! Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等！就在那儿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait! Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就在我坐下去的时候！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right as I'm sitting down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他是怎么干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how he does it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可就在他动以前 那里没有钉子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's no tack before he moves
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他一动 就有钉子了 是巧合吗？ 我不信！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and after he moves, there's a tack. Coincidence? I think not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伯尼… - 别叫我“伯尼”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bernie... - Don't "Bernie" me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个小鬼头是坏蛋！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This little rat is guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,帕尔太太 您和您的儿子可以走了 抱歉给您添麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and your son can go now, Mrs. Parr. I'm sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你又放他走了？ 他是坏蛋！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're letting him go again? He's guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.62,0:14:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看他小脸的得意样就知道 坏蛋 我说了 坏蛋！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can see it on his smug little face. Guilty, I say, guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,达什 今年你是第三次 给叫到办公室了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dash, this is the third time this year you've been sent to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.84,0:15:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得找个更好的办法 更有建设性的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find a better outlet. A more... constructive outlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你让我去参加运动会 没准就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I could, if you'd let me go out for sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你知道我们为什么 不能那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, you know why we can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证会有分寸的 我只会赢他们一点点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise I'll slow up. I'll only be the best by a tiny bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,达什尔·罗伯特·帕尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dashiell Robert Parr,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.76,0:15:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个特别争强好胜的孩子 还有一点爱卖弄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are an incredibly competitive boy. And a bit of a showoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你最禁不起诱惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last thing you need is temptation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你老是说“尽力而为” 可你从来就不是那个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always say, "Do your best." But you don't really mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.67,0:15:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我能尽力的 为什么不让我尽力？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't I do the best that I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 如今的世界只要我们 溶入其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, honey, the world just wants us to fit in,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,为了溶入其中 我们就得 像其他所有人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to fit in, we just gotta be like everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸常说我们有超能力 没什么好难为情的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad always said our powers were nothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.89,0:15:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们的超能力让我们很特别 - 人人都很特别 达什\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Our powers made us special. - Everyone's special, Dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.89,0:15:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那也就是说没什么人是特别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is another way of saying no one is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,莱丁杰 你上哪儿去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rydinger, where you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.92,0:15:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 托尼 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Tony. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 托尼 可以帮你拿书吗？ - 那可有点好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Tony, can I carry your books? - That's kind of funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.13,0:16:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 托尼 你打橄榄球吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Tony, do you play football?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.43,0:16:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼 我们去游泳吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, I thought we were gonna go swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他看了我一眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 薇奥莱特！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Violet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶的孩子 在车道上放这个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darn kids. Sitting on the driveway...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.09,0:16:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你又在做鬼脸 - 才没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're making weird faces again. - No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你做鬼脸了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make weird faces, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你非得在饭桌上看吗？ - 啊哈 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you have to read at the table? - Uh- huh. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小口咬 达什 呀！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smaller bites, Dash. Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍勃 帮这个小肉桶把肉切一下吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob, could you help the carnivore cut his meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,达什 有什么学校里的事 要跟爸爸说吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dash, you have something you wanna tell your father about school?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 我们解剖了一只青蛙 - 达什又给叫到办公室去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, we dissected a frog. - Dash got sent to the office again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好 很好 - 不 鲍勃 这不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good. Good. - No, Bob, that's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 达什又给叫到办公室去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Dash got sent to the office again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.39,0:17:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ 为什么？ - 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?! What for? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他在老师的椅子上放图钉… 是在上课的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He put a tack on the teacher's chair... during class.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没人看见 你在录像带上 都很难看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody saw me. You could barely see it on the tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给你拍了录像带可还是 让你逃过了？ 哇！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They caught you on tape and you still got away with it? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你准是一直在练 你的动作有多快？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have been booking. How fast were you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.91,0:18:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是要鼓励他这么干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not encouraging this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.61,0:18:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊 我只是问有多快…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not, I'm just asking how fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 先是汽车 现在又要 花钱修饭桌…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. First the car, now I gotta pay to fix the table...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.73,0:18:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,给 我去拿个新盘子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. I'm getting a new plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你怎么样 小薇？ 学校里怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how about you, Vi? How was school?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没什么好说的 - 你的饭都没动过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing to report. - You've hardly touched your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不想吃肉糕 - 哦 今晚又要留下剩饭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not hungry for meatloaf. - Well, it is leftover night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有肉排 意大利面… 你想要什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have steak, pasta... What are you hungry for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 托尼·莱丁杰 - 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tony Rydinger. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.35,0:18:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 你真的在想他 - 我说了闭嘴 你这小臭虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, you are. - I said, shut up, you little insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是在想他 - 别在饭桌上大喊大叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, she is. - Do not shout at the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的！ - 孩子们！听妈妈的话！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey! - Kids! Listen to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,假如我们有托尼糕 她就会吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd eat if we were having Tony loaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:19:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你会变成吐司面包！ - 别在家里乱跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're gonna be toast! - Stop running in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.48,0:19:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 不准用超能力场！ - 是你起的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, no force fields! - You started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.19,0:19:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你坐下！你也坐下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sit down! You sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.89,0:19:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,薇奥莱特！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Violet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,“西蒙·J·帕拉蒂诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Simon J. Paladino,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,超级英雄权利的长期鼓吹者 失踪了”？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}longtime advocate of superhero rights, is missing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 激光眼 - 鲍勃！你该来管管了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gazerbeam. - Bob! It's time to engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,做点什么！别光站着！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do something! Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要你插手！ - 你要我插手？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need you to intervene! - You want me to intervene?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我插手了！我插手了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'm intervening!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,薇奥莱特 放开你弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Violet, let go of your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哈啰？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.84,0:19:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,去开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 卢修斯！ - 嘿 飞毛腿 海伦 小薇 杰杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Lucius! - Hey, Speedo. Helen, Vi, Jack- Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是贵“冰”来访 - 哈！这话可真新鲜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lce of you to drop by. - Ha! Never heard that one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卢修斯！ - 哇！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lucius! - Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈哈 - 噢！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ha, ha. - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢它碎掉的时候 - 我会晚点回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I like it when it shatters. - I'll be back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们两个去哪？ - 今天星期三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you two going? - It's Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,保龄球之夜 替我向汉妮问好 卢修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bowling night. Say hello to Honey for me, Lucius.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,会的 晚安 海伦 晚安 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will do. Good night, Helen. Good night, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别以为你去校长室的事 就这么了结了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think you've avoided talking about the principal's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.79,0:20:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸和我还会找你谈话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father and I are still gonna discuss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是只有我一个人给叫到 办公室去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the only kid who's been sent to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.10,0:20:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别的孩子没有超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other kids don't have superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在 绝对正常… - 你知道什么是正常？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, it's perfectly normal... - What do you know about normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这个家里有人知道什么是正常吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does anyone in this family know about normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.31,0:20:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等一下 小姑娘 - 我们都装得很正常 我也想做正常人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, wait a minute, young lady. - We act normal. I wanna be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.41,0:20:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,可唯一正常的人就是杰杰 他 还不会自己用马桶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only normal one is Jack- Jack, and he's not even toilet trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.42,0:20:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说做正常人真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant about being normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就有大麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now I'm in deep trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.63,0:20:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 要是再来上一道死光 我就要进棺材了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, one more jolt of this death ray and I'm an epitaph.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.84,0:20:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好在我总算找到了躲的地方 然后无情男爵怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow I managed to find cover. What does Baron Von Ruthless do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.14,0:20:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他开始长篇大论 - 他开始长篇大论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He starts monologuing. - He starts monologuing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他开始发表早就准备好的演讲 说我跟他比起来怎么怎么弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He starts this prepared speech about how feeble I am compared to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.15,0:21:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,说我的失败怎么怎么不可避免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How inevitable my defeat is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,世界很快就是他的了 怎样怎样…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the world will soon be his. Yada, yada, yada.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没完没了 - 没完没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yammering. - Yammering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙打得我没脾气 而且还说个没完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, the guy has me on a platter, and he won't shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.27,0:21:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 穆尼西堡 我们接到23- 56… - 23- 56 那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Municiberg, we have a 23- 56... - 23- 56, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.97,0:21:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抢劫？ - 真是倒霉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Robbery? - This is just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.27,0:21:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 想去抓强盗吗？ - 不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Want to catch a robber? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,实话跟你说吧 我宁可去打保龄球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell you the truth, I'd rather go bowling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你说 要是我们真的去干我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, what if we actually
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,老婆以为我们在干的事情 那不好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did what our wives think we're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.49,0:21:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是平衡一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just to shake things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.09,0:21:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是一个人 那个大块头还和他在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not alone. The fat guy's still with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一直在说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.30,0:21:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们在这里算是干什么？ - 保护别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are we doing here? - Protecting people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没人求我们保护 - 你想要别人请你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nobody asked us. - You need an invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.91,0:21:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,想啊 对 我们一直偷偷摸摸 地干这种事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like one, yes. We keep sneaking out to do this, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.61,0:21:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你记得激光眼吗？ - 报上提到过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You remember Gazerbeam? - There was something in the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.12,0:21:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他也过不惯小老百姓的生活 - 你什么时候看见他的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He had trouble with civilian life. - When did you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,以前的老伙计我都没看见 只有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see anyone from the old days. Just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.03,0:21:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在我们又是这样来赌运气 - 得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And we're pushing our luck as it is. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:22:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次是很好玩 可要是我们 一直这么干…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was fun the first time, but if we keep doing this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.23,0:22:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们接到火灾报告… - 火灾 我们离那儿很近！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have a report on a fire... - A fire. We're close!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好啊 宝贝！ - 我们会给逮住的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, baby! - We're gonna get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.05,0:22:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,火灾！好啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.66,0:22:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所有人都在这儿了？ - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that everybody? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.37,0:22:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 最好是这样 - 你就不能把这火灭了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It better be. - Can't you put this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不出足够厚的冰！它蒸发得太快了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't lay down a layer thick enough! It's evaporating too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.18,0:22:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么意思？ - 意思是这里太热了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that mean? - It means it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.38,0:22:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我都给烤干了 鲍勃 - 你的冰用完了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm dehydrated, Bob. - You're out of ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你不可能用完的 你连空气里的水都能用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't run out. You can use water in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这种空气里没有水！你又有什么借口 把肌肉用完了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no water in this air! What's your excuse, run out of muscle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.09,0:22:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能把墙打破 这幢楼快撑不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't smash walls. The building's getting weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.10,0:22:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它会砸到我们头顶上的 - 我想去打保龄球的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's gonna come down on top of us. - I wanted to go bowling!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.00,0:22:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧！跟紧了！会很热的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Stay right on my tail! This is gonna get hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.84,0:23:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.14,0:23:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不对劲啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.45,0:23:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们看起来就像三流坏蛋！ - 你可以从空气里取水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We look like incompetent bad guys! - You can get water out of the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.05,0:23:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,别动！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.36,0:23:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,别动！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.56,0:23:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我口渴 - 我说了别动！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm thirsty. - I said freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.47,0:23:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是喝点水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just getting a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.28,0:23:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你已经喝过了 现在… - 我知道 我知道 冰冻！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've had your drink. Now... - I know. I know. Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.29,0:23:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,警察！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police officers!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.91,0:24:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这次真是太险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was way too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.71,0:24:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们再也不能这么干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not doing that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.02,0:24:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你确认要换目标吗？ 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Verify you want to switch targets? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.32,0:24:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 这就是他一直在找的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me. This is the one he's been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.76,0:24:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我以为你最晚11点能回来 - 我说了会晚点回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought you'd be back by 11. - I said I'd be back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.17,0:24:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我是以为你会晚一点回来 只要你最后还是回来了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assumed you'd be back later. If you came back at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.97,0:24:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就算是“晚点回来” - 好了 我已经回来了 行了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You'd be "back later". - Well, I'm back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.59,0:25:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是碎石吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this rubble?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.79,0:25:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微练习一下而已 免得身体僵掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just a little workout. Just to stay loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.40,0:25:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我是怎么想的 真是的！我们不能再暴露身份了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how I feel about that. Darn you! We can't blow cover again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 总之是因为那幢楼塌了 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The building was coming down anyway. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.21,0:25:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你把一幢楼弄塌了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knocked down a building?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.91,0:25:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,它着火了 结构不牢了 所以就塌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was on fire. Structurally unsound. It was coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.91,0:25:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你又在偷听警方频道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been listening to the police scanner again?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.42,0:25:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在为人民服务 你好像觉得那是坏事一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I performed a public service. You act like that's a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.72,0:25:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是坏事 鲍勃！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a bad thing, Bob!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.22,0:25:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为了你能重新体验那些光辉岁月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uprooting our family again,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.14,0:25:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就害得我们搬家 这就是坏事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you can relive the glory days is a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.33,0:25:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,总比假装那些事没有发生过要强！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's better than acting like they didn't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.33,0:25:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对！它们是发生过！可是我们家里的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! They happened! But this, our family,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.84,0:25:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,才是正在发生的事 鲍勃 你却一点不关心！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is what's happening now, Bob. And you are missing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.54,0:25:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是不敢相信你不想参加 儿子的毕业典礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you don't want to go to your own son's graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.75,0:25:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那不算毕业 他只是从四年级升五年级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a graduation. He's moving from fourth to fifth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.35,0:25:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那也是一次典礼！ - 那是有病！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a ceremony! - It's psychotic!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.35,0:25:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一直在变着法子表扬平庸之才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They keep creating new ways to celebrate mediocrity
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.16,0:25:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可要是出了什么不同寻常的人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if someone is exceptional...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你自己的事 鲍勃 是达什的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not about you, Bob. It's about Dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.46,0:25:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你想替达什做点事吗？ 那就让他真正去竞争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to do something for Dash? Let him actually compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.37,0:26:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让他去参加运动会！ - 我也不想当恶人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let him go out for sports! - I will not be made the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.27,0:26:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道我们为什么不能那样做 - 因为他会大获成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know why we can't do that. - Because he'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.17,0:26:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你自己的事！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.38,0:26:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 达什 我知道你在听 出来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Dash. I know you're listening. Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.49,0:26:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,小薇 你也是 出来吧 小姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vi? You, too, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.79,0:26:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 出来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.29,0:26:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 孩子们 我们只不过在讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, kids. We're just having a discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.00,0:26:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,讨论得很大声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty loud discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.90,0:26:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那没关系 重要的是 妈妈和我一直是战友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's okay. What's important is that Mommy and I are a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.60,0:26:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们团结一致 共同对抗… - 老顽固？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're united, uh, against forces of... - Pigheadedness?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.41,0:26:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想说邪恶来着 - 对不起 把你们吵醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was gonna say evil. - We're sorry we woke you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.02,0:26:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么事 去睡觉吧 已经很晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's okay. Go back to bed. It's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.42,0:26:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 晚安 妈妈 晚安 爸爸 - 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night, Mom. Night, Dad. - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.62,0:26:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我们都该去睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, we should all be in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.15,0:26:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,索赔请求 索赔号158183…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Request claim on claim numbers 158183...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.95,0:27:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没把他找来？ 他在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't you got him yet? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.66,0:27:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哈夫先生要你到他办公室谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Huph would like to talk to you in his office.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.36,0:27:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在？ - 现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now? - Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.89,0:27:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,坐 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.40,0:27:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我很不开心 鲍勃 很不开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not happy, Bob. Not happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.61,0:27:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 问我为什么呀 - 好吧 为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ask me why. - Okay. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.41,0:27:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,什么为什么？ 说具体点 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why what? Be specific, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.51,0:27:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你不开心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you unhappy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.22,0:27:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你的客户让我不开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your customers make me unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.12,0:27:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你接到投诉了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you've gotten complaints?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.92,0:27:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,投诉我倒能应付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Complaints I can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.52,0:27:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可我不能应付的是你的客户 对我们公司内部运作方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I can't handle is your customers' inexplicable knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.23,0:27:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然了如指掌！他们都是专家 专家！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of lnsuricare's inner workings! They're experts. Experts, Bob!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.23,0:27:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会利用每一个漏洞 绕开 每一个障碍！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exploiting every loophole, dodging every obstacle!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们完全看穿了我们的制度！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're penetrating the bureaucracy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.04,0:28:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我做了什么不合规定的事吗？ - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did I do something illegal? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.85,0:28:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能说我们不该帮助客户吗？ - 法律要求我对此回答“否”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We shouldn't help our customers? - The law requires that I answer no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.25,0:28:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们应该帮助人们 - 应该帮助我们的人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're supposed to help people. - Help our people!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.56,0:28:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,从我们的股东开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starting with our stockholders.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.46,0:28:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在帮他们解决困难呢 唔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's helping them out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.97,0:28:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 鲍勃 一家公司…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Bob, a company...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.27,0:28:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就好比一台巨大的时钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is like an enormous clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.97,0:28:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,…就好比一台… 说得对 非常正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is like an enormous... Yes. Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.08,0:28:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,只有当每一个小齿轮都紧密咬合 它才能工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It only works if all the little cogs mesh together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.79,0:28:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 时钟需要清洗 加润滑油 和上紧发条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, a clock needs to be cleaned, well- lubricated and wound tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.29,0:28:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一流的时钟有着按设计 密切配合的轴承和齿轮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best clocks have jewel movements, cogs that fit, that cooperate by design.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.00,0:28:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在打比方 鲍勃 知道我在用齿轮比喻什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm being metaphorical, Bob. Know what I mean by cooperative cogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.41,0:28:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍勃？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.21,0:28:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍勃？ 我跟你说话的时候 你要看着我 帕尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob? Look at me when I'm talking to you, Parr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.42,0:28:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 外面那个人 他需要帮助 - 不要改变话题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That man out there, he needs help. - Don't change the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.62,0:29:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们现在讨论的是你的态度 - 他正被人抢！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're discussing your attitude. - He is getting mugged!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.52,0:29:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 那么但愿我们不用赔他钱 - 我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, let's hope we don't cover him. - I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.33,0:29:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,给我站住 要不就解雇你！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop right now or you're fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.44,0:29:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,把门关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.44,0:29:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,到这边来 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get over here, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.35,0:29:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我很不开心 鲍勃 很不开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not happy, Bob. Not happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.06,0:29:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他跑了 - 那也很好嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He got away. - Good thing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.96,0:29:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你差一点就丢了你的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were this close to losing your...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.58,0:29:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,请立刻前往722手术室报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please report to operating room 722 immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.10,0:29:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他怎样？ - 不会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How is he? - He'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.60,0:29:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我被解雇了 是吗？ - 你说呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm fired, aren't I? - You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.40,0:29:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还能说什么 瑞克？ - 能说的你以前都说过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What can I say, Rick? - Nothing you haven't said before.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.21,0:30:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有个人遇到麻烦了 - 有个人总是遇到麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Someone was in trouble. - Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.31,0:30:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不得不做一些事 - 每次你说这话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I had to do something. - Every time you say that,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.01,0:30:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我就要忙上一个半月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a month and a half of trouble for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.22,0:30:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,用掉纳税人的几十万块钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hundreds of thousands of taxpayer's dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.62,0:30:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 我们花钱封住这些公司的嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know. - We pay to keep the company quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.32,0:30:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们赔偿损失 消除记忆 重新安置你的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We pay damages, erase memories, relocate your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.53,0:30:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一次比一次困难 钱啊钱啊钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time it gets harder. Money, money, money.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.13,0:30:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也不能老这么干 我们很 感激你在当年做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't keep doing this. We appreciate what you did in the old days,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.24,0:30:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可那种时候已经过去了 从现在起 你得自力更生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but those days are over. From now on, you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,听着鲍勃 也许我还能再安置你一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Bob. Maybe I could relocate you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.36,0:30:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 看在过去的份上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know, for old times' sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.35,0:30:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能对我的家人那样做 他们都刚刚安顿下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do that to my family. Everyone just got settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.56,0:30:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我能解决的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make it work. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.86,0:30:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好自为之吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.98,0:30:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你在等什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.28,0:30:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 我猜…是奇迹吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Something amazing, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.59,0:31:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我也在等 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.33,0:31:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,唔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.35,0:31:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,“静止不动”？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Hold still"?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.85,0:31:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,匹配：神奇超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Match: Mr. Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.46,0:31:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,室内安全 开始传送信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Room is secure. Commence message.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.77,0:31:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 神奇超人 对 我们知道你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Mr. Incredible. Yes, we know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.17,0:31:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,请放心 我们会保守你的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest assured, your secret is safe with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.27,0:32:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫米拉婕 我们有一些共同点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Mirage. We have something in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.78,0:32:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,按照政府的说法 我们 两人都是不存在的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to the government, neither of us exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.69,0:32:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请认真听好 因为本信息是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please pay attention, as this message is classified
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.95,0:32:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,机密的 而且不会重复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and will not be repeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.99,0:32:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我代表政府的一个绝密部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I represent a top secret division of the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.80,0:32:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,设计并测试试验中的技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}designing and testing experimental technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.40,0:32:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你的特殊能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we have need of your unique abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们的试验区发生了一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something happened at our testing facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.81,0:32:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的！ - 啊？ 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey! - Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.21,0:32:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 晚饭准备好了 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dinner's ready. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.71,0:32:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,…虽然它被封闭在一个孤岛上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it is contained within an isolated area,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.02,0:32:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但它有可能给自身和我们的设施造成 难以估量的破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it threatens to cause incalculable damage to itself and our facilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.22,0:32:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可能造成上亿元的损失…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}jeopardizing hundreds of millions of dollars...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.13,0:32:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你房里有人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is someone in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.83,0:32:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 电视啦 我在看电视 - 由于它的敏感性…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's the TV, trying to watch. - Because of its sensitive nature...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.13,0:32:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别看了 该吃饭了 - 马上就好！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop. It's time for dinner. - One minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.54,0:32:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你接受的话 报酬将是 你当前年薪的三倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you accept, your payment will be triple your current annual salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.54,0:32:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,请按名片上的号码打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call the number on the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.22,0:32:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会用语音匹配技术保证安全性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voice- matching will ensure security.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.45,0:32:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,超级英雄并没有离去 神奇超人 你还在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The supers aren't gone, Mr. Incredible. You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.45,0:32:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你仍旧可以创造丰功伟绩 当然…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can still do great things. Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.46,0:33:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,…你也可以去偷听警方频道 选择权在你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you can listen to police scanners. Your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.76,0:33:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以在24小时内作出答复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have 24 hours to respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.67,0:33:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,考虑一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.12,0:33:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,本信息将自我销毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This message will self- destruct.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.33,0:33:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh- oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.25,0:34:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像有很多心事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are one distracted guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.96,0:34:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？ 我也不想这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I? I don't mean to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.06,0:34:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你很想去当英雄 你现在的工作又很无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you miss being a hero and your job is frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.87,0:34:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是希望你明白 尽量保住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want you to know how much it means
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.39,0:34:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在的工作对我有多重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to me that you stay at it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.67,0:34:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的？ 说到我的工作… - 怎么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey? About the job? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.38,0:34:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 出了点事 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Something's happened. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.68,0:34:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 唔… - 怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The, uh... - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.38,0:34:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,公司要派我去…唔…开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The company is sending me to, uh, a conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.19,0:34:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开会？ - 在外地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A conference? - Out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.69,0:34:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我要离开几天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna be gone for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.29,0:34:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们以前从来没派你去开过会 这是好事 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've never sent you to a conference before. This is good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.60,0:34:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.60,0:34:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞧 他们终于承认你的能力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see? They're finally recognizing your talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.11,0:34:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要高升了 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're moving up. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.61,0:34:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的！这可太好了！ - 对 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey! This is wonderful! - Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.82,0:34:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.12,0:34:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我是神奇超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Mr. Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.82,0:34:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.93,0:35:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,万能机器人9000 是一台绝密的战斗机器人原型机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Omnidroid 9000 is a top secret prototype battle robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.24,0:35:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,它的人工智能使它能够解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its artificial intelligence enables it to solve any problem
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.94,0:35:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,遇到的任何问题 不幸的是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's confronted with. And, unfortunately...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.85,0:35:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,让我猜一下 它已经聪明到 不肯服从命令了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess. It got smart enough to wonder why it had to take orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.55,0:35:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去了对它的控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost control.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.72,0:35:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,现在它就在 丛林里游荡 威胁着我们的设施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's loose in the jungle, threatening our facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.26,0:35:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为了安全 我们只好撤走岛上所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had to evacuate all personnel from the island for their own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.86,0:35:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我要怎么进入？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am I going in?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.96,0:35:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,考虑到万能机器人的防御能力 我们只能从5000英尺空投\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Omnidroid's defenses necessitate an air drop from 5000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.87,0:35:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,它的隐形装置使我们很难跟踪它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its cloaking devices make it difficult to track.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.47,0:35:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可以肯定的是它正在岛的南半部份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're pretty sure it's on the southern half of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.88,0:35:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一点 显然我们对它投资很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more thing. Obviously it represents a significant investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.68,0:35:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我在不摧毁它的情况下把他关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to shut it down without destroying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.09,0:35:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你是神奇超人嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are Mr. Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.62,0:36:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须警告你 它是学习型机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to warn you, it's a learning robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.52,0:36:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你和它战斗的时间越长 它就越能了解该怎样击败你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every moment you fight it increases its knowledge of how to beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.23,0:36:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,关掉它 动作要快 不能摧毁它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut it down. Do it quickly. Don't destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.63,0:36:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有 不要死 - 好极了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And don't die. - Great. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.08,0:36:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏开场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.36,0:38:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我的腰！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.86,0:40:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,出乎意料 我们一定要把他带回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprising. We must bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.66,0:40:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,解除警报 请他来吃晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sound the all clear, and invite him to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.89,0:40:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,最要紧的是不要让他看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most important, keep things light.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.10,0:40:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,夸他一下 让他感到我们 很欣赏他的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praise him. Make him feel like we appreciate his abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.00,0:40:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是穿得太正式了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I overdressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.71,0:40:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 你穿得很时髦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, you look rather dashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.71,0:40:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想我们的雇主… - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I take it our host is... - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.51,0:40:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他不想和我们共进晚餐 他希望你能理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't be dining with us. He hopes you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.92,0:40:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 但我通常比较想知道为谁工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. I do usually make it a point to know who I'm working for.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.63,0:40:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他喜欢保持一点神秘感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He prefers a certain amount of anonymity.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.53,0:40:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 你是能理解的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely, you of all people understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.23,0:41:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不明白 有那么多地方可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just wondering, of all the places
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.66,0:41:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,住 为什么偏偏选择住在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to settle down, why live...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.94,0:41:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,火山边？ 他迷恋力量 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a volcano? He's attracted to power. So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.35,0:41:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是我们共有的弱点 - 看来有点不牢靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a weakness we share. - Seems a bit unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.25,0:41:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你这种看法是因为误解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prefer to think of it as misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.56,0:41:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不都这样吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't we all?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.16,0:41:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,火山土是地球上最肥沃的土壤之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Volcanic soil is among the most fertile on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.96,0:41:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这桌上的东西都是这里长的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything at the table was grown right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.17,0:41:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得怎样？ - 全都很可口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How does it compare? - Everything's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.39,0:42:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 快点 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jeez. - Hurry, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.79,0:42:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你上班要迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you'll be late for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.40,0:42:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝你工作顺利 亲爱的 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have a great day, honey. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.50,0:43:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伺候好客户 努力往上爬… - 还要养好家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help customers, climb ladders... - Bring bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.50,0:43:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that jazz.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.12,0:43:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你预约了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have an appointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.62,0:43:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我是老朋友 我只想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an old friend. I just wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.92,0:43:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所有访客都必须… - 走开 检查电网去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All visitors are required... - Go check the electric fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.43,0:43:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？ 你是谁？ 想干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? Who are you? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.93,0:43:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 你发福了 进来吧 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, you've gotten fat. Come in. Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.05,0:43:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 一切都很好 都很好 上帝啊 没什么可抱怨的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, things are going quite well. Quite well. My God, no complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.86,0:43:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你知道 和以前不一样了 完全不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you know, it is not the same. Not the same at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.36,0:43:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是还上过电视吗？ 是什么演出 在布拉… 布拉格？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weren't you in the news? Some show in Prayge... Prague?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.17,0:43:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,米兰 亲爱的 是米兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Milan, darling. Milan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.17,0:43:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,超级名模 她们根本 没什么超级的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supermodels. Nothing super about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.28,0:43:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,任性 愚蠢 瘦得像火柴棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spoiled, stupid, little stick figures
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.78,0:43:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,总是浓妆艳抹 只会为自己着想的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with poofy lips who think only about themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.38,0:43:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,切！我以前可是为诸神设计服装的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feh! I used to design for gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.89,0:44:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不过也许你要来求我？ 接到你的电话我可是吃了一惊呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But perhaps you come with a challenge, eh? I was surprised to get your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.30,0:44:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,E 我只要你帮我补一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}E, I just need a patch job.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.20,0:44:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,唔 这是超网眼式的 过时了 不过很结实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm. This is megamesh. Outmoded, but very sturdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.50,0:44:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你却把它扯破了！你到底在干什么 罗伯特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you've torn right through it! What have you been doing, Robert?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.91,0:44:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,月下扮英雄？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moonlighting hero work?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.41,0:44:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那肯定是很久以前的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must have happened a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.52,0:44:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了 这是叫花子穿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see. This is a hobo suit, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.72,0:44:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你可不能穿这个出门 我不允许！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't be seen in this. I won't allow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.53,0:44:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,十五年前可能允许 可现在嘛...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen years ago, maybe, but now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.53,0:44:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么意思？ 这可是你设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean? You designed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.63,0:44:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远不看从前的作品 那只会影响现在的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never look back, darling. It distracts from the now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.84,0:44:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要一套新衣服 这是可以肯定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need a new suit. That much is certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.64,0:44:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,新衣服？ 我到底上哪儿能弄到新衣服？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new suit? Where the heck am I gonna get a new suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.24,0:44:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你弄不到的！不可能！我又太忙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't! It's impossible! I'm far too busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.75,0:44:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,所以快点求我吧 趁我还没有恢复理智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So ask me now, before I again become sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.05,0:44:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你想给我做套新衣服？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. You want to make me a suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.95,0:44:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你也太过分了 亲爱的！不过我接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You push too hard, darling! But I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.76,0:44:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它的设计会很大胆 很惹眼！ - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It will be bold. Dramatic! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.56,0:44:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很高雅！ - 对 经典的衣服 就像劲爆侠！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heroic! - Yeah, something classic, like Dynaguy!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.87,0:45:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！他可真帅！那披风 还有靴子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! He had a great look! Oh, the cape and the boots...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.28,0:45:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不能加披风！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No capes!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.78,0:45:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是该听我的吗？ - 你记得霹雳头吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't that my decision? - Do you remember Thunderhead?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.58,0:45:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,高个子 能驾驭暴风雨 是个好人 跟孩子们很合得来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tall, storm powers. Nice man. Good with kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.49,0:45:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听我说 E… - 58年11月15号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Listen, E... - November 15th of '58.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.90,0:45:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,本来一切顺利 可是他的披风却被 导弹尾翼挂住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All was well, another day saved when his cape snagged on a missile fin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.30,0:45:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,霹雳头不是很聪明…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thunderhead was not the brightest bulb...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.61,0:45:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,风云女！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stratogale!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.71,0:45:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,57年4月23号 披风被 吸进发动机叶片里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April 23rd, '57. Cape caught in a jet turbine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.01,0:45:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能以偏概全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't generalize about these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.42,0:45:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,中元侠 在高速电梯上出事 劲爆侠 起飞时被钩住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meta- man. Express elevator. Dynaguy, snag on takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.82,0:45:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,天外飞降 被卷进旋风里 不能加披风！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splashdown, sucked into a vortex. No capes!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.03,0:45:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你的新衣服会在下次任务 以前做好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, go on. Your new suit will be finished before your next assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.23,0:45:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我已经不当英雄了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I'm retired from hero work.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.34,0:45:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,和我一样 罗伯特 可你 还不是又来找我了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As am I, Robert. Yet, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.24,0:45:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,E 我只需要把衣服补一下 为了怀旧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}E, I only need a patch job. For sentimental reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.15,0:45:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我也会把叫花子衣服补好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. I will also fix the hobo suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.25,0:46:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是绝顶高手 E - 对 我知道 亲爱的 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're the best of the best, E. - Yes, I know, darling. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.88,0:46:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别接 亲爱的 我来听！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't answer it, honey, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.28,0:46:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂？ - 我们有新任务要给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - We have a new assignment for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.49,0:46:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你什么时候能到这儿？ - 我明天早上动身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How soon can you get here? - I'll leave tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.09,0:46:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就到时候见 - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See you there. - Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.70,0:46:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谁打来的？ 是…公司的人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was that, honey? The, uh, office?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.51,0:46:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,又要开会 时间很赶 不过你也知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another conference. Short notice, but you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.41,0:46:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,…工作需要嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...duty calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.12,0:46:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鲍勃？ - 唔 什么事 亲爱的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bob? - Yeah, what's up, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.63,0:46:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝你… 祝你旅途愉快 - 谢谢 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ha... have a great trip. - Thanks, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.93,0:46:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我到的时候会给你打电话的 - 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll call you when I get there. - I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.44,0:47:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很爱很爱 - 我也爱你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So much. - I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.36,0:47:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我是您的自动机长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your automated Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.96,0:47:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,您还想要香槟加橙汁吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you care for more mimosa?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.27,0:47:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要是想的话 你可别介意 谢谢 - 别客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't mind if I do. Thanks. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.88,0:47:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,当前岛上气温为78度 天气良好 适合飞行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Currently 78 degrees in Nomanisan. Perfect weather for flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.59,0:47:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,请系好安全带 我们要降落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please fasten your seat belt. We're beginning our descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.93,0:48:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 神奇超人 衣服很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Mr. Incredible. Nice suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.13,0:48:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.24,0:48:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,回到这里很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to be back, Mirage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.18,0:48:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,两点钟会在会议室给你听任务简报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be briefed on your assignment in the conference room at two.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.88,0:48:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- D座 A- 113号房 - 两点 知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- D Wing, room A- 113. - 2:00. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.39,0:48:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,会议室见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.23,0:49:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,埃德娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edna.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.24,0:49:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请让我和埃德娜通话 - 我是埃德娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd like to speak to Edna, please. - This is Edna.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.04,0:49:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是海伦 - 哪个海伦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- E? This is Helen. - Helen who?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.85,0:49:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,海伦·帕尔 你知道的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helen Parr? You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.05,0:49:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,弹力女侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elastigirl?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.15,0:49:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的！都过去这么多年了！真是太久了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling! It's been such a long time after all these years! So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.46,0:49:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是有段日子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.26,0:49:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍勃只会放心让一个人给他补 超人服 那个人就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one person Bob would trust to patch his supersuit. That's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.97,0:49:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对 对 对 很棒吧 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes, yes. Marvelous, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.17,0:49:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,比他从前穿的那些难看睡衣强多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much better than those horrible pajamas he used to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.97,0:49:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经都做好了 你什么时候过来看？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are finished. When are you coming to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.78,0:49:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我打电话来是为了… - 不要让我求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm calling about... - Don't make me beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.28,0:49:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会求人的 你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't do it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.73,0:49:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,求你？ 不 我打电话来是为了衣服的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beg, no, I'm calling about suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.19,0:49:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是 是为了鲍勃的衣服！我打电话来是为了鲍勃的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob's suit! I'm calling about Bob's suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.19,0:49:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你一小时以内来吧 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come in one hour, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.91,0:50:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,说定了 好吗？ 好的 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I insist, okay? Okay. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.24,0:50:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,它更大！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.34,0:50:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,它更坏！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's badder!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.95,0:50:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 神奇超人打不过它！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, it's too much for Mr. Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.46,0:50:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,终于可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's finally ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.16,0:50:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我用好多超级英雄磨炼它 好让它能够跟你打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I went through quite a few supers to get it worthy to fight you,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.27,0:50:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 它还是不够强！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but man, it wasn't good enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.37,0:50:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在你打坏上一个以后 我只好 再对它做一些大修改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you trashed the last one, I had to make some major modifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.48,0:51:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,当然这很困难 不过为了你 值得这么干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure it was difficult, but you are worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.88,0:51:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说 我也是你的头号崇拜者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, after all, I am your biggest fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.09,0:51:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 巴迪？ - 我不叫巴迪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Buddy? - My name is not Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.90,0:51:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也不叫神奇小子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's not IncrediBoy either!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.10,0:51:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那已经过去了 那时候我心里想的只是帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ship has sailed. All I wanted was to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.80,0:51:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想要帮忙！可你对我说了什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only wanted to help! And what did you say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.41,0:51:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那就飞回家去 巴迪 我是单干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly home, Buddy. I work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.11,0:51:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心都被撕碎了 不过我也学到了重要的一课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It tore me apart. But I learned an important lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.72,0:51:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不能相信任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't count on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.12,0:51:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是你的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially your heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.12,0:51:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我那样对你是错了 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong to treat you that way. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.23,0:51:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧见了吗？ 现在你知道尊重我了 因为我对你是威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? Now you respect me, because I'm a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.63,0:51:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,天下的事情就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the way it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.33,0:51:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,世上有许多人想得到尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a lot of people, whole countries who want respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.24,0:51:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可他们要付出很高的代价才能得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they will pay through the nose to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.14,0:51:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我是怎么发财的？ 我发明武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think I got rich? I invented weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.85,0:51:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我有了一部只有我自己才能 打败的武器 如果我开动它 就会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I have a weapon only I can defeat. And when I unleash it, I'll get...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.86,0:51:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你这老狐狸！你引诱我发表长篇大论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sly dog! You got me monologuing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.76,0:52:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是不能相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.76,0:52:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很酷吧？ 是零点能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cool, huh? Zero- point energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.27,0:52:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我把最好的发明留给自己用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I save the best inventions for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.47,0:52:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在够强了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I good enough now?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.68,0:52:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在谁才是超人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's super now?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.38,0:52:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是万恶霸王！是你的冤家对头和…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Syndrome! Your nemesis and...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.29,0:52:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 很好！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.01,0:52:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 试试这个是不是够劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, try this one on for size, big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.37,0:53:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,激光眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gazerbeam.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.39,0:53:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,克洛诺斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kronos?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Kronos?"
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.02,0:53:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,生命读数为负 神奇超人已被消灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life reading negative. Mr. Incredible terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.33,0:54:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这个项目耗费了我毕生的精力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This project has completely confiscated my life, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.04,0:54:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,只有英雄的工作才能这样吸引我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consumed me as only hero work can.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.19,0:54:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我得承认 这是我最好的作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My best work, I must admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.45,0:54:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,简洁 优雅 又大胆 你会非常喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simple, elegant, yet bold. You will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.35,0:54:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- E 我只要… - 我做好了罗伯特的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- E, I just... - I did Robert's suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.56,0:54:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,因为它实在太美了 我只好接着做下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it turned out so beautiful, I had to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.26,0:54:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你真是很高兴 可我不 明白你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great to see you, but I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.27,0:54:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我只要… - 对 语言是无用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I just... - Yes, words are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.57,0:54:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,真要说起来话就太长了 亲爱的 太长了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gobble, gobble, gobble. Too much of it, darling. Too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.57,0:54:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才要让你亲眼看我的作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why I show you my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.78,0:54:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才会来这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why you are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.09,0:54:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,埃德娜模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edna Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.29,0:54:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还有客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.82,0:55:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,来 坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.53,0:55:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加奶油和糖？ - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cream and sugar? - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.83,0:55:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就从小宝宝开始 - 开始？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I started with the baby. - Started?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.54,0:55:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,安静点 亲爱的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh! Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.75,0:55:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我把它裁得稍微 宽松点 好让他能自由活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cut it a little roomy for the free movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.64,0:55:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这种布料可以让娇嫩的皮肤感到 非常舒适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fabric is comfortable for sensitive skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.05,0:55:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还能经受住1000度以上的高温\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and can also withstand a temperature of over 1000 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.36,0:55:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对防弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Completely bulletproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.76,0:55:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而且可以机洗 亲爱的 这可是新增加的特性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And machine washable, darling. That's a new feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.47,0:55:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底以为小宝宝会去干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What on earth do you think the baby will be doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.47,0:55:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 可以肯定的是我不知道 有备无患嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm sure I don't know, darling. Luck favors the prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.88,0:55:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道小宝宝的超能力是什么 所以只包含了基本功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know the baby's powers, so I covered the basics.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.18,0:55:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 杰杰根本没有超能力 - 没有吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jack- Jack doesn't have any powers. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.58,0:55:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,反正他穿上以后会让你大吃一惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he'll look fabulous anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.29,0:55:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你儿子的衣服设计为可以 承受巨大的摩擦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your boy's suit I designed to withstand enormous friction
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.40,0:56:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,同时不会升温或破损 很有用的功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without heating up or wearing out. A useful feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.80,0:56:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你女儿的衣服很巧妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your daughter's suit was tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.51,0:56:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于开发出一种耐用的材料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I finally created a sturdy material
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.26,0:56:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可以在她隐身时和她一起消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that will disappear completely as she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.22,0:56:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你的衣服可以在不伤到你自己 的情况下 尽可能地伸长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your suit can stretch as far as you can, without injuring yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.82,0:56:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还能恢复原状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and still retain its shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.83,0:56:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,几乎是坚不可摧…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Virtually indestructible...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.33,0:56:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,…但又和埃及棉一样透气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...yet it breathes like Egyptian cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.14,0:56:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,每套衣服都附带了导航设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As an extra feature, each suit contains a homing device,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.64,0:56:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要按一下按钮就可以知道 穿戴者的精确地理坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}giving you the precise global location of the wearer at the touch of a button.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.85,0:56:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 亲爱的 你怎么想？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, darling? What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.75,0:56:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么想？ 鲍勃已经洗手不干了！我也不干了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I think? Bob is retired! I'm retired!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.66,0:56:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们全家都在隐居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our family is underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.46,0:56:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你又背着我让我丈夫重操旧业？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You helped my husband resume secret hero work behind my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.97,0:56:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我还以为你知道呢 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I assumed you knew, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.17,0:56:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么他会对你保密？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would he keep secrets from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.17,0:56:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会 以前没有 现在也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wouldn't. Didn't. Doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.28,0:56:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,男人在罗伯特这个年纪总是 很不牢靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men at Robert's age are often unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.89,0:57:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,容易产生弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prone to weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.19,0:57:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么？ - 你知道他在哪儿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you saying? - Do you know where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.69,0:57:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 你知道他在哪儿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Of course. - Do you know where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.43,0:58:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 我们有人受伤了！ - 快点 咱们过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, hey. We got a man down! - Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.54,0:58:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧？ 出什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.14,0:58:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,暂停监视和跟踪 继续清查…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break surveillance and engage. Continuing sweep...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.72,1:00:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,(密码)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.39,1:00:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Insuricare公司 - 哦 你好 我是海伦·帕尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Insuricare. - Oh, hello. This is Helen Parr.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.89,1:00:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍勃·帕尔是我丈夫 能不能请你把他住的宾馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob Parr is my husband. I was wondering if you could give me
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.10,1:00:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,电话号码告诉我？ 我手上的号码不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the number of the hotel he's staying at? The number I have is no good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.30,1:00:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 帕尔先生已经不在这里工作了 - 你说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Parr no longer works here. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.31,1:00:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在出差呀 公司派他去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on a business trip. A company retreat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.91,1:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我的记录显示大约两个月前 他已经被辞退了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My records say he was terminated almost two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.76,1:01:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：宇宙人-消灭， 原型机：万能机器人1代)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.86,1:01:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：灵魂波-消灭， 原型机：万能机器人1代)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.76,1:01:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：心眼侠-消灭， 原型机：万能机器人1代)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.66,1:01:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：高爆侠， 原型机：万能机器人1代-消灭)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.56,1:01:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：高爆侠-消灭， 原型机：万能机器人2代)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.66,1:01:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：飞拦截-消灭， 原型机：万能机器人2代)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.66,1:01:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：剃刀石-消灭， 原型机：万能机器人2代)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.66,1:01:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：当破侠-消灭， 原型机：万能机器人3代)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.66,1:01:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：超震荡， 原型机：万能机器人3代-消灭)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.86,1:01:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：超震荡-消灭， 原型机：万能机器人4代)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.96,1:01:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：顶峰女-消灭， 原型机：万能机器人4代)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.76,1:01:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(疾电侠)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.46,1:01:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,(信风侠)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.06,1:01:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(矢量女)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.66,1:01:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,(激光眼)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.66,1:01:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,(消灭)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.66,1:01:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说你不知道他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you don't know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.67,1:01:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,想找找看吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to find out?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.86,1:01:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(搜索：弹力女侠)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.66,1:01:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,(方位)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.66,1:01:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(未知)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.76,1:01:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(搜索：寒冰侠)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.06,1:01:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,(方位：已知)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.26,1:01:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,(神奇超人)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.56,1:01:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(对手：神奇超人-消灭， 原型机：万能机器人9代)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.66,1:02:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(万能机器人10代 最终设计)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.48,1:02:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是个大傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.68,1:02:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是我没有看好他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I let this happen, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.09,1:03:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,新跑车 减肥 那根金发 他的谎话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new sports car, the getting in shape, the blond hair, the lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.09,1:03:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他是在想方设法重温旧事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, he attempts to relive the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.50,1:03:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我要失去他了！我该怎么办？ 我该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm losing him! What'll I do? What'll I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.30,1:03:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的这叫什么话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.31,1:03:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你是弹力女侠啊！上帝呀！给我振作起来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are Elastigirl! My God! Pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.71,1:03:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你该怎么办？ 这还用问吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will you do? Is this a question?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.92,1:03:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让他知道你还记得他是神奇超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show him you remember that he is Mr. Incredible,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.42,1:03:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还要提醒他你是什么人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you will remind him who you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.52,1:03:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你已经知道他在哪儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.39,1:03:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧！勇敢面对问题！战斗！赢！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Confront the problem! Fight! Win!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.23,1:03:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,回来时候给我打电话 亲爱的 和你见面我很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And call me when you get back, darling. I enjoy our visits.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.14,1:03:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还有很多剩饭菜 热一下就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's lots of leftovers that you can reheat.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.64,1:03:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要叫达什做作业 还有 你们两个都要准时睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure Dash does his homework. And both of you, get to bed on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.85,1:03:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天晚上会回来的 会晚点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be back tonight. Late.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.65,1:03:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这段时间你可以看好家的 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can be in charge that long, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.75,1:03:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对 可是为什么又要我看家？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. But why am I in charge again?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.56,1:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 只不过你爸爸有点麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. Just a little trouble with Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.16,1:03:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说爸爸遇上麻烦了？ 还是说爸爸就是麻烦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean Dad's in trouble, or Dad is the trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.57,1:03:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说他遇上麻烦了 或者他 也会变成麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean either he's in trouble, or he's going to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.68,1:04:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？ 那里搞来的 妈妈？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that? Where'd you get that, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.38,1:04:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了一套酷衣服？ 嘿 那是给我们的吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made a cool outfit? Hey, are those for us?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.69,1:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都有酷衣服？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all get cool outfits?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.29,1:04:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,达什！你马上给我回来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dash! You come back here this moment!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.50,1:04:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 斯纳格 谢谢你给我回电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Snug. Thanks for getting back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.90,1:04:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这么说很突然 可我还是 希望能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this is short notice, but I was hoping that I could...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.60,1:04:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？ - 瞧 我是达速侠！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are these? - Look, I'm The Dash!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.61,1:04:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 达速侠很喜欢 - 稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Dash likes. - Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.41,1:04:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,马上脱下来 别让人看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that off before somebody sees.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.30,1:04:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己还要带上一样的衣服呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're packing one just like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.42,1:04:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是不是有什么事情瞒着我？ - 别闹了 我还在接电话呢…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you hiding something? - Please. I'm on the phone...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.42,1:04:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 达什！ - 这是你的 特制的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dash! - This is yours. It's specially made.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.73,1:04:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是怎么回事？ - 你们都不许进来！我要准备行李！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on? - You're not coming! I gotta pack!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.23,1:04:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪里看出来这是特制的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think it's special?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.34,1:04:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 可你想 妈妈干吗要藏着它呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Why'd Mom try to hide it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.85,1:04:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,斯纳格 我是要你还我一个人情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snug, I'm calling in a solid you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.26,1:05:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想要什么？ - 一架飞机 你有这么快的东西吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you need? - A jet. What do you got that's fast?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.86,1:05:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,让我想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.78,1:05:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,接近目的地 IG99请求准入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Island approach. India Golf niner- niner checking in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.68,1:05:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在上方作目视飞行 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}VFR on top. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.29,1:05:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,塔台 我是IG99...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Island tower, this is India Golf niner-niner...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.20,1:05:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,请求引导 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}requesting vectors to the initial.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.01,1:05:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张 海伦 放松 姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, Helen. Easy. Easy, girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.71,1:05:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你反应过头了 一切都很顺利 他们只是都去喝咖啡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're overreacting. Everything's fine. They're just all getting coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.02,1:05:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,正好一起去的 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the same time. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.25,1:06:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你 先生 真是“神奇超人”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sir, truly are "Mr. Incredible".
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.25,1:06:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前崇拜你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was right to idolize you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.25,1:06:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就知道你是硬汉 可你居然会躲在另一个超人的骨头后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always knew you were tough, but tricking the probe
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.86,1:06:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,骗过探测器？ 哦 老兄！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by hiding under the bones of another super? Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.86,1:06:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在想起来还是觉得佩服！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still geeking out about it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.77,1:06:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,可接下来你就不够意思了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you had to just go and ruin the ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.17,1:06:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇超人居然呼救？ “救救我 救救我”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, Mr. Incredible calling for help? "Help me, help me."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.28,1:06:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,丢脸 丢脸 丢脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lame, lame, lame.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.78,1:06:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 你找的是谁？ - 找谁？ 你在说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, who did you contact? - Contact? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.20,1:06:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是昨晚23:07\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am referring to last night at 23:07 hours
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.00,1:06:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在你到处偷窥的时候 你发出了一个 导航信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you were snooping around. You sent out a homing signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.21,1:06:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道导航装置的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know about the homing device.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.36,1:06:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有一架政府的飞机请求在这里降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now a government plane is requesting permission to land here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.32,1:06:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你找的是谁？ - 我没有叫飞机来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who did you contact? - I didn't send for a plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.53,1:07:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把通话录音放给他听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play the transmission.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.23,1:07:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- IG99请求准入 - 海伦！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- India golf checking in. - Helen!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.14,1:07:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说你认识这帮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you do know these people.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.34,1:07:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那我就小小地问候他们一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, I'll send them a little greeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.85,1:07:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢！ - 薇奥莱特！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ow! - Violet!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.85,1:07:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.15,1:07:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是达什偷跑出来 我知道 你肯定要为这事骂我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dash ran away, I knew I'd get blamed for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.56,1:07:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.26,1:07:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是你说：“妈妈好像有点事 我们一定要弄明白”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said, "Something's up with Mom. We have to find out what.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.26,1:07:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- …这不是我的错！ - 百分之百都是你的主意！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...and it's not my fault! - Hundred percent all- yours idea!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.97,1:07:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 你们把杰杰一个人扔下了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. You left Jack- Jack alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.97,1:07:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们当然找人代看了 - 我们找了人的 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Of course we got a sitter. - We got someone, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.88,1:07:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们不会让他一人在家的 - 多谢了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We wouldn't do that. - Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.28,1:07:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你们找的是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, well, who'd you get?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.48,1:07:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么也不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to worry about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.99,1:07:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我天生就会带孩子 还上过课 学过心肺复苏术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got baby- sitting wired. I've taken courses, learned CPR,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.39,1:07:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 成绩优秀 还拿了证书 - 凯莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- excellent marks and certificates. - Kari.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.80,1:07:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我带了莫扎特的音乐 在他睡觉时放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought Mozart to play while he sleeps
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.10,1:07:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,因为专家说莫扎特的音乐能让 宝宝更聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because leading experts say Mozart makes babies smarter.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.21,1:07:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,凯莉…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kari...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.41,1:07:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,妙就妙在他们不一定要听 因为他们是睡着的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The beauty is they don't have to listen 'cause they're asleep!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.31,1:08:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我爸妈当年放过莫扎特就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish my parents played Mozart
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.31,1:08:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,因为不管什么人说话 我总有一半 时间听不懂他们说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because half the time I don't know what anyone's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.52,1:08:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,凯莉 这事我真觉得不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kari, I really don't feel comfortable with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.02,1:08:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,给你惹的麻烦我会补偿的 不过我还是想叫服务公司来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pay you for your trouble, but I'd rather call a service.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.23,1:08:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真的没有必要 帕尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's really no need, Mrs. Parr.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.13,1:08:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,宝宝有什么事我全能对付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can totally handle anything this baby can dish out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.93,1:08:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对不对 小宝宝？ 我能对付的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't I, little baby? I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.74,1:08:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能对付呀？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who can handle it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.25,1:08:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,IG99报告误击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}India Golf niner- niner transmitting in the blind guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.26,1:08:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,取消攻击 重复 取消攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disengage. Repeat, disengage.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.70,1:09:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 取消攻击 这是友机…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat, disengage. Friendlies...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.91,1:09:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不！快取消导弹攻击 要我 做什么都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Call off the missiles. I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.31,1:09:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,太晚了 晚了整整十五年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late. Fifteen years too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.38,1:09:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在你西南偏南方向20英里的是友机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friendlies two- zero miles south- southwest of your position.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.32,1:09:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,高度10 航向正东 取消攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angels 10. Track east. Disengage.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.92,1:09:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,小薇！在飞机周围造一个力场出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vi! Put a force field around the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.63,1:09:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过我们不能用超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said not to use our powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.43,1:09:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我说过 照我现在说的做！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what I said. Listen to what I'm saying now!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.83,1:09:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,取消攻击 重复 取消攻击！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disengage. Repeat, disengage!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.64,1:09:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈？ - 薇奥莱特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom? - Violet!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.55,1:09:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,呼救 IG99被友方锁定 取消！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayday. India Golf niner- niner is buddy- spiked. Abort!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.65,1:09:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机上有小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are children aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.25,1:09:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 飞机上有小孩 - 不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There are children aboard! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.36,1:09:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快给我们造个力场！ - 我从来没做过这么大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put a field around us now! - I've never done one that big.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.36,1:09:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快做！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.97,1:09:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,取消 取消 取消！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abort, abort, abort!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.57,1:09:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,取消 取消 取消！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abort, abort, abort!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.42,1:10:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,振作点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.43,1:10:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈！ - 大家都冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom! - Everybody calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.43,1:10:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我要告诉你们不该怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what we're not gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.54,1:10:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不该慌张 我们不该… 当心！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not gonna panic, we're not... Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.36,1:10:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 天哪！这是谁的主意啊？ - 我们该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God! Who's idea was this? - What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.26,1:10:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们死定了！我们死定了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're dead! We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.46,1:11:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 飞机爆炸了！ - 我们捡了一条命 可还是死定了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It blew up! - We survived but we're dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.27,1:11:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,够了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.67,1:11:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会死的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.67,1:11:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个都给我精神点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both of you will get a grip.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.48,1:11:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,否则就关你们一个月！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or so help me I will ground you for a month!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.08,1:11:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.38,1:11:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,已经确认命中 目标被摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a confirmed hit. Target was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.49,1:11:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 你会挺过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, you'll get over it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.49,1:11:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像记得你是喜欢“单干”的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I seem to recall you prefer to "work alone".
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.01,1:11:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快放了我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release me. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.61,1:11:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不然怎样？ - 我就捏碎她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Or what? - I'll crush her.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.82,1:11:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你这话听起来可有点邪恶 好 你就捏吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds a little dark for you. Well, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.62,1:11:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这很容易的 就像折断牙签一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be easy. Like breaking a toothpick.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.63,1:11:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那就让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.75,1:12:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.15,1:12:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,即使你已经没什么可失去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even when you have nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.45,1:12:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你很弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.16,1:12:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你已经没兴趣了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've outgrown you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.97,1:12:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那是近程导弹 陆基的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those were short- range missiles. Land- based.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.38,1:12:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,往那个方向去希望最大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That way is our best bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.98,1:12:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去想杀我们的人呆的地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to go toward the people that tried to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.99,1:12:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 假如那里是陆地 那你说得对 - 你希望我们游过去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If it means land, yes. - Do you expect us to swim there?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.19,1:12:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你们相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect you to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.28,1:13:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个好兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a trooper.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.49,1:13:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你太让我自豪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.79,1:13:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.50,1:13:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你们的爸爸是遇到麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think your father is in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.60,1:13:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你大概没注意到 我 们现在也好不到哪儿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you haven't noticed, we're not doing so hot either.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.51,1:13:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to look for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.81,1:13:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说在我回来以前 这里就交给你了 薇奥莱特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that means you're in charge until I get back, Violet.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.71,1:13:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 你听见她说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - You heard her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.52,1:14:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,把这戴上 你们的身份是你 们最重要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put these on. Your identity is your most valuable possession.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.03,1:14:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要保护好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protect it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.13,1:14:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要是出了什么事 就用你们的超能力吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if anything goes wrong, use your powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.93,1:14:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可你说过永远不要用… - 我知道我说过！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But you said never to use... - I know what I said!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.04,1:14:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还记得星期六上午节目里的那些坏蛋吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember the bad guys on those shows you used to watch on Saturday mornings?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.55,1:14:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这些家伙可跟他们不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, these guys are not like those guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.05,1:14:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会因为你们是小孩就手下留情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't exercise restraint because you're children.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.66,1:14:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一有机会就会杀了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will kill you if they get the chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.96,1:14:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不要给他们机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not give them that chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.16,1:14:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈？ - 小薇 我就全靠你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom? - Vi, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.47,1:14:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有些… - 我就全靠你了 坚强点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's... - I'm counting on you. Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.47,1:14:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,达什 要是出了什么事 我要你能跑多快就跑多快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dash, if anything goes wrong, I want you to run as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.88,1:14:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能跑多快就跑多快？ - 能跑多快就跑多快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- As fast as I can? - As fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.48,1:14:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,躲在这里 互相保护 天亮前我会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay hidden. Keep each other safe. I'll be back by morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.29,1:14:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.60,1:14:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 飞机上的事 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, what happened on the plane. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.70,1:15:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我想帮忙的 可你要我帮的时候… 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to help. When you asked me to... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.11,1:15:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh. It isn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.01,1:15:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我一下子对你要求这么高也不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't fair for me to suddenly ask so much of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.91,1:15:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可现在情况不同了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But things are different now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.52,1:15:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是再缺少信心 后果我们大家都经受不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And doubt is a luxury we can't afford anymore, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.62,1:15:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你的力量要比你意识到的更大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have more power than you realize.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.04,1:15:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不要多想 也不要担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think. And don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.73,1:15:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候你会知道怎么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the time comes, you'll know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.43,1:15:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你天生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in your blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.89,1:16:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是软弱 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not weak, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.59,1:16:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.69,1:16:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,珍视生命不是弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Valuing life is not weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.10,1:16:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 假如你说的是牢房里的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Look, if you're talking about what happened in the containment unit,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.80,1:16:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那时一切都在我掌握之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had everything under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.90,1:16:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,漠视生命也不是力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And disregarding it is not strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.71,1:16:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他虚张声势 我就拆穿了他 亲爱的 就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I called his bluff, sweetheart, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.51,1:16:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他不会真那么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew he wouldn't have it in him to actually...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.12,1:16:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,下次你要是想赌博的话 拿你自己的命去赌吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time you gamble, bet your own life!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.52,1:17:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,火箭？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rocket?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.58,1:19:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说这不好玩 不过我还是想到别处看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not that this isn't fun, but I'm gonna go look around.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.69,1:19:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为这里是什么地方？ 你以为我们在度假？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think is going on here? You think we're on vacation?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.70,1:19:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈和爸爸可能有生命危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom and Dad's lives could be in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.60,1:19:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,或者更糟 他们的婚姻也有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or worse, their marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.20,1:19:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的婚姻？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their marriage?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.31,1:19:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说那些坏蛋是想拆散 爸爸和妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the bad guys are trying to wreck Mom and Dad's marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.91,1:19:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,当我没说吧 你还太小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it. You're so immature.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.12,1:19:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要去走走看看 - 妈妈说了要躲在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna go look around. - Mom said to stay hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.42,1:20:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会走出山洞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna leave the cave. Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.68,1:20:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,酷！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.88,1:20:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,酷！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.29,1:20:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,明白 我们已经可以发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger. We are ready for launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.71,1:21:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小薇！小薇！ - 你干了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Vi, Vi! - What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.03,1:21:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,ETA 29 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ETA two- niner. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.14,1:21:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,TCI完成 黄色状况 状态正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TCI clear. Condition yellow. Status norm.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.74,1:21:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,IFF没有反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not responding to IFF.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.65,1:21:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,IRCM读数为负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}IRCM reads negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.25,1:21:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鲍勃 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bob. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.95,1:21:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么也没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.10,1:22:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,请出示身份证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Identification, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.00,1:22:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿！薇奥莱特！过来 瞧 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! Hey, Violet! Come here, look. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.90,1:22:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它会说话！ - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It talks! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.11,1:22:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在那儿 那只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. That one.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.51,1:22:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,语音密钥不正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voice key incorrect.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.71,1:22:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- “语音密钥”？ - 语音密钥不正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Voice key"? - Voice key incorrect.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.02,1:22:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.52,1:22:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么办？ - 快跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do we do? - Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.32,1:22:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 往哪儿跑？ - 离开这里！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are we going? - Away from here!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.43,1:22:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,入侵警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intruder alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.07,1:22:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 时间不多 - 对 时间不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There isn't much time. - No, there isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.47,1:22:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,其实根本没有时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, there's no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.88,1:23:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 求你… - 你为什么会在这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please... - Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.08,1:23:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么可能把我放下来？ 你还能从我这里夺走什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you possibly bring me lower? What more can you take away from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.09,1:23:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你的家人在坠机时没有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family survived the crash.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.99,1:23:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们现在就在岛上！ - 他们还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're here on the island! - They're alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.72,1:23:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 海伦？ - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Helen? - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.02,1:23:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be Mrs...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.82,1:23:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她正在帮我逃走 - 不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She was helping me to escape. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.33,1:23:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I was doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.93,1:23:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.43,1:23:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,放开 你这个恶心 爱撒谎 不忠的讨厌鬼！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go, you lousy, lying, unfaithful creep!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.84,1:23:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么可能背叛这么完美的女人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could I betray the perfect woman?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.44,1:23:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 你这是在说我？ - 孩子们呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, you're referring to me now? - Where are the kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.65,1:23:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们弄响了警报 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They triggered the alert. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.65,1:23:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 警卫正在树林里 快走 - 咱们的孩子有危险？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Security's in the jungle. Get going. - Our kids are in danger?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.05,1:23:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你担心有危险 干吗还带他们出来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you suspected danger, why'd you bring them?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.46,1:23:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是偷偷跟来的 你也没资格这样说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They stowed away. You're not striking the proper tone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.37,1:24:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得他们是超人？ - 达什 记住妈妈说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Think they're supers? - Dash, remember what Mom said.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.18,1:24:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 不许说话！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.78,1:24:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 站住！不许动！ - 达什 快跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold it! Freeze! - Dash, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.78,1:24:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 快跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.69,1:24:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们是超人！ - 去抓那男孩！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're supers! - Get the boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.49,1:24:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,给我出来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.82,1:25:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm alive. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.62,1:27:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我早该告诉你我被解雇了 我承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've told you I was fired, I admit it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.43,1:27:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可我不想让你担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I didn't want you to worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.23,1:27:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想让我担心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't want me to worry?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.63,1:27:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们现在却在荒无人烟 的树林里奔命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're running for our lives through some godforsaken jungle.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.63,1:27:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你老是想和我吵 可我只是很高兴你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep trying to pick a fight, but I'm just happy you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.94,1:27:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在那里 隐身小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're there, Little Miss Disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.36,1:27:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你躲不过我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't hide from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.58,1:27:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在那里 - 嘿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There you are. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.18,1:27:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不许碰我姐姐！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch my sister!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.90,1:28:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么做到的？ - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How are you doing that? - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.10,1:28:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 千万别停啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you do, don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.23,1:28:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈！爸爸！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Dad! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.83,1:28:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.23,1:28:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们都没事 - 你们都没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're all right. - You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.14,1:28:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们担心死了 - 我以为再也见不到你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We were so worried. - I thought I'd never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.07,1:28:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.39,1:29:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,时间到！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time out!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.90,1:29:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这算什么？ 一样的制服？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have we here? Matching uniforms?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.90,1:29:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不！弹力女侠？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Elastigirl?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.01,1:29:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你娶了弹力女侠？ 哇！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You married Elastigirl? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.31,1:29:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还干得很卖力！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And got busy!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.72,1:29:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这是超人一家啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a whole family of supers.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.52,1:29:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我是中大奖了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like I've hit the jackpot!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.83,1:29:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 这真是太好了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is just too good!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.33,1:29:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这艘船的设计很独特… - 事故中无人死亡…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The ship's unique design... - There were no fatalities...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.93,1:29:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哈？ 哈？ 哦 快点！你得承认这很酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh? Huh? Oh, come on! You gotta admit, this is cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.04,1:29:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就像电影一样！机器人会戏剧性地出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like a movie! The robot will emerge dramatically,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.35,1:29:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,造成一些破坏 到处是尖叫的人群！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do some damage. Throngs of screaming people!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.25,1:29:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就在一切希望都落空的时候 万恶霸王会拯救世界！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just when all hope is lost, Syndrome will save the day!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.26,1:29:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我会成为比从前的你还伟大的英雄！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be a bigger hero than you ever were!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.76,1:29:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说你杀光真的英雄 好让自己假冒英雄？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean you killed off real heroes so that you could pretend to be one?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.77,1:30:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我是真的 真到足可以打败你！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm real. Real enough to defeat you!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.37,1:30:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我不是依靠你那种罕见的 天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I did it without your precious gifts,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.89,1:30:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你那种特殊的超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your oh- so- special powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.18,1:30:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让他们看到英雄的壮举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give them heroics.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.58,1:30:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让他们看到有史以来 最震撼人心的英雄壮举！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give them the most spectacular heroics anyone's ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.88,1:30:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,然后等我老了 也玩够了 我就会卖掉我的发明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when I'm old and I've had my fun, I'll sell my inventions
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.29,1:30:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这样所有人都能成为超级英雄 所有人都能当超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that everyone can be superheroes. Everyone can be super.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.89,1:30:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要是所有人都是超人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when everyone's super...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.10,1:30:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,…那也就没有超人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...no one will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.54,1:30:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,自由射击！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire at will!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.65,1:31:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,它打得坦克毫无还手之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's overwhelming the tanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.76,1:31:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.46,1:31:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的错 我是一个糟糕的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my fault. I've been a lousy father.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.57,1:31:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对自己拥有的东西视而不见 因为自己被低估而耿耿于怀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blind to what I have. So obsessed with being undervalued
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.27,1:31:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 却低估了你们所有人 - 爸爸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- that I undervalued all of you. - Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.47,1:31:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘 别打岔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh. Don't interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.68,1:31:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我太沉缅于过去…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So caught up in the past that I...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.98,1:31:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是我最重要的冒险 可我却差一点忘记你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are my greatest adventure. And I almost missed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.89,1:31:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓 我要把大家安全地带出去 假如我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear, I'm gonna get us out of this safely if I...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.09,1:31:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我看爸爸今天进步非常大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I think Dad has made some excellent progress today
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.00,1:31:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不过现在我们该下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I think it's time we wind down now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.40,1:31:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得回大陆去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get back to the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.31,1:31:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我在来的路上看见过一个飞机库 笔直走就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw an aircraft hangar on my way in. Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.93,1:31:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,卫兵都去哪儿了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are all the guards?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.63,1:31:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,上 上！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.04,1:32:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们每跑一次 你就开一瓶酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, every time they run, you take a shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.36,1:32:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个机库 可我没看见飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the right hangar, but I don't see any jets.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.07,1:32:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 飞机不够快 - 什么东西比飞机还快？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A jet's not fast enough. - What's faster than a jet?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.17,1:32:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,坐火箭怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a rocket?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.08,1:32:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好主意！我可不会开火箭 - 没必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Great! I can't fly a rocket. - You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.28,1:32:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,用他们上次发射时的坐标就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use the coordinates from the last launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.79,1:32:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 我敢肯定万恶霸王 现在已经改过密码了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. I bet Syndrome's changed the password by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.60,1:32:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该怎么登录电脑呢？ - 来求我吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do I get into the computer? - Say please.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.12,1:33:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 汉妮？ - 怎么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.23,1:33:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的超人服在哪？ - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is my supersuit? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.23,1:33:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的超人服在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is my supersuit?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.83,1:33:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我把它放到别处了 - 在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I put it away. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.94,1:33:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么想知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you need to know?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.34,1:33:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我要用它！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need it!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.54,1:33:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你别想溜出去逞英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think about running off doing no derrin' do.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.65,1:33:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,为这次宴会我们都筹划两个月了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been planning this dinner for two months!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.25,1:33:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在公众有危险！ - 我的晚会才有危险！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The public is in danger! - My evening's in danger!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.15,1:33:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我衣服在哪儿 你这娘们！我是在跟你谈大事！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me where my suit is, woman! We are talking about the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.76,1:33:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,“大事”？ 我是你老婆！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Greater good"? I am your wife!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.96,1:33:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你的头等大事就是我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the greatest good you are ever gonna get!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.47,1:33:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.68,1:33:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的宝宝！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.28,1:33:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 超级英雄回来了！ - 那是钢火侠吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The supers have returned! - Is that Fironic?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.79,1:33:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钢火侠？ - 不对 钢火侠的衣服不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fironic? - No, Fironic has a different outfit.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.49,1:33:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 不是 我是新的超级英雄！我是万恶霸王！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I'm a new superhero! I'm Syndrome!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.20,1:34:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 退后吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, stand back.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.01,1:34:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有人要教这个铁球懂点礼貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone needs to teach this hunk of metal a few manners.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.22,1:34:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.46,1:34:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们还没到吗？ - 该到的时候总会到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are we there yet? - We get there when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.37,1:34:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么样 亲爱的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing, honey?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.57,1:34:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我非得回答吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I have to answer?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.58,1:34:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们 照我说的系好安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids, strap yourselves down like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.59,1:35:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.19,1:35:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 薇奥莱特？ 预备...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready, Violet? Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.80,1:35:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.00,1:35:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,落地会很重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be rough.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.02,1:35:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人在金融区 走那个出口？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robot's in the financial district. Which exit?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.32,1:35:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 特拉克生大道 - 那样就到市中心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Traction Avenue. - That'll take me downtown.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.72,1:35:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我走第七大道吧 怎样？ - 别走第七大道！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I take Seventh, don't I? - Don't take Seventh!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.33,1:35:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好 已经开过头了 - 你问我怎么走 我已经告诉你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Great, we missed it. - Ask how to get there, I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.03,1:35:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 特拉克生大道 - 那就去市中心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Traction. - That'll take me downtown.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.93,1:35:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,进右车道！亮灯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the right lane! Signal!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.74,1:35:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不能走特拉克生大道！ - 你要开过头了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not Traction! - You're gonna miss it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.58,1:36:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,后面的人都好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everybody okay back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.38,1:36:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好极了 爸爸！ - 咱们再来一次吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Super- duper, Dad! - Let's do that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.59,1:36:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里等着 藏好了 我这就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here and stay hidden. I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.59,1:36:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？ 让我在边上当看客？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While what? I watch helplessly from the sidelines?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.40,1:36:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不同意 - 我要你和孩子们一起等着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think so. - I'm asking you to wait with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.20,1:36:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你 想都别想 你是我丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm telling you not a chance. You're my husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.70,1:36:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是好是坏我都和你在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm with you for better or worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.61,1:36:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我非得一个人干不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.71,1:36:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你把这当什么？ 做游戏吗？ - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is this to you? Playtime? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.61,1:36:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为了让你再成为神奇超人？ - 不是！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you can be Mr. Incredible again? - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.72,1:36:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是为什么？ - 我不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then what? - I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.42,1:36:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不什么？ - 我不够强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not what? - I'm not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.22,1:36:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这样你就能更强？ - 对 不是的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This will make you stronger? - Yes. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.22,1:36:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那这算什么？ 是你的锻炼方式？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what this is? Some sort of workout?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.43,1:36:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能再失去你了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't lose you again!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.93,1:36:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不能 不能有第二次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. Not again.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.84,1:36:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 不够强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not... strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.65,1:36:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我们合作 你就不用有多强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we work together, you won't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.66,1:37:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道会发生什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.56,1:37:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是超级英雄啊 还能发生什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're superheroes. What can happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.57,1:37:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,小薇！达什！不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vi! Dash! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.38,1:37:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,薇奥莱特！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Violet?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.89,1:37:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸！ - 快走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad! - Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.01,1:37:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没事 妈妈 真的 - 呆在这儿 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm okay, Mom. Really. - Stay here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.23,1:37:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,寒冰侠来也！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frozone!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.63,1:37:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.94,1:37:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍勃！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.46,1:38:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,万恶霸王的遥控器！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Syndrome's remote!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.38,1:38:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那个遥控器能控制机器人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The remote controls the robot!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.49,1:38:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 扔过来！扔过来！ - 跑吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Throw it, throw it! - Go long!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.11,1:38:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,接住了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.11,1:38:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 打掉他的枪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, take out its guns!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.83,1:39:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,接住你了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.39,1:39:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 我拿到了！我拿到遥控器了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, I've got it! I've got the remote!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.10,1:39:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,遥控器！控制什么的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A remote? A remote that controls what?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.91,1:39:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The robot?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.12,1:40:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,它又来了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.63,1:40:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那样不对 - 给我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That wasn't right. - Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.63,1:40:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们阻止不了它 唯一硬到 可以打穿它的东西是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't stop it. The only thing hard enough to penetrate it is...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.54,1:40:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,…它自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.84,1:40:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,它越走越近了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.44,1:40:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有用啊！ - 孩子们！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It doesn't work! - Kids!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.05,1:40:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,它没起什么作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.85,1:40:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我们争取点时间 - 试试旁边那个按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Try to buy us some time. - Try the one next to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.06,1:40:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.37,1:40:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 再按一下那个按钮！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Press that button again!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.08,1:40:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不对 是另一个！第一个！ - 第一个按钮！明白了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, the other one! The first one! - First button! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.38,1:40:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它越走越近了！ - 当心！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's getting closer! - Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.79,1:40:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快离开这里！ - 我们哪儿也不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out of here! - We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.59,1:40:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 按按钮呀！ - 还不行！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Press the button! - Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.39,1:41:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 顶住！ - 你在等什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hang on! - What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.00,1:41:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,等目标再近点！你只有一发炮弹！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A closer target! You got one shot!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.80,1:41:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,全都趴下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody duck!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.24,1:41:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 冰老弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.55,1:41:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？ 不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.95,1:41:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见了吗？ 就是要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see that? That's the way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.06,1:41:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是老套路了 - 对 没什么套路比得上老套路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's old school. - Yeah. No school like the old school.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.17,1:41:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就像当年一样 啊！ - 就像当年一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just like old times. Oh! - Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.47,1:41:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对 那时候也是这么疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Hurt then too.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.78,1:42:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经冻结了万恶霸王的全部财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've frozen all of Syndrome's assets.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.28,1:42:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕他打一个喷嚏 我们也会 带着手帕和手铐找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he even sneezes, we'll be there with a hanky and a pair of handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.99,1:42:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这个国家的人民都很感激你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people of this country are indebted to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.39,1:42:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不是说我们 可以不用躲躲藏藏了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this mean we can come out of hiding?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.30,1:42:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,让政客们去考虑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the politicians figure that one out.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.30,1:42:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要我向你们保证 我们会把其他事都安排好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been asked to assure you we'll take care of everything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.90,1:42:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你干得很好 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did good, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.21,1:42:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我是凯莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, this is Kari.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.21,1:42:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个和杰杰有关的问题…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a question about Jack- Jack...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.21,1:42:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 我们坐的可是豪华轿车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We're in a limo.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.01,1:42:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你把头发梳到后面去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you're wearing your hair back?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.02,1:42:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 我只是… 是啊 - 很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I just... yeah. - It looks good.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.92,1:42:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 爸爸 - 你扔那车的时候真是酷！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, Dad. - That was cool when you threw that car!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.63,1:42:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不如你在水上跑的时候酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not as cool as you running on water.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.23,1:42:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候你用手臂钩住那个坏蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was sweet when you snagged that bad guy with your arm
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.84,1:42:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,又把他甩到另一个家伙身上 真是痛快！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and whiplashed him into the other guy. Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.84,1:42:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在听电话呢 - 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm trying to listen to messages. - It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.74,1:42:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,杰杰很好 可是出了点怪事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack- Jack is fine, but weird things are happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.35,1:42:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,当然杰杰还是很好 可我 真是见了鬼了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack- Jack's still fine, but I'm getting really weirded out!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.95,1:42:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你们什么时候回来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When are you coming back?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.66,1:42:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,…干掉了那些想杀我们的家伙！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...aced those guys that tried to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.16,1:43:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,从来没见过这么棒的假日！我爱我们一家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the best vacation ever! I love our family.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.27,1:43:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉不太好 帕尔太太！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not fine, Mrs. Parr!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.27,1:43:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,把那个放下！停下！你要给我打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put that down! Stop it! You need to call me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.07,1:43:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要帮忙 太太…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need help, Mrs...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.38,1:43:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍勃 你听听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob, listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.08,1:43:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我要叫警察了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna call the police...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.18,1:43:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我是凯莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, this is Kari.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.78,1:43:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才说了些胡话 我很抱歉 不过你们的宝宝有些特别的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry for freaking out, but your baby has special needs.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.09,1:43:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们派人接我的班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for sending a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.19,1:43:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有叫人替她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't call a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.00,1:43:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘 宝宝在睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh. The baby is sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.11,1:43:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你们夺走了我的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took away my future.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.41,1:43:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我这是知恩图报 别担心 我会当个好师傅的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm simply returning the favor. Don't worry, I'll be a good mentor.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.92,1:43:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,会支持他 鼓励他 你做不到的事我都能做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supportive, encouraging. Everything you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.32,1:43:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,过些时候 谁知道呢 说不定他会变成我的好伙伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in time, who knows, he might make a good sidekick.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.44,1:43:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他要逃了 鲍勃！我们得赶紧做点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's getting away, Bob! We have to do something now.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.26,1:44:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.57,1:44:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快拦下他！扔点东西上去！ - 不行 会打到杰杰的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop him! Throw something! - I might hit Jack- Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.98,1:44:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,扔我上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.59,1:44:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍勃 扔我上去！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob, throw me!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.30,1:44:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.01,1:44:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这事还没完！总有一天我会抓到你儿子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't the end of it! I will get your son, eventually.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.61,1:44:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我会抓到你儿子的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get your son!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.72,1:44:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.23,1:45:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看着妈妈 宝贝 别朝下看 妈妈接住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at Mommy, honey. Don't look down. Mommy's got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.14,1:45:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.66,1:45:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.97,1:45:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是我们又得搬家了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this mean we have to move again?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.88,1:45:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.28,1:45:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真是帅呆了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was totally wicked!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.26,1:45:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,(三个月以后)
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.01,1:45:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,田径运动会上一定要有啦啦队长吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have to have cheerleaders at the track meet?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.01,1:45:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那有什么意思吗？ - 我总觉得那样更…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is that all about? - I always thought it was more...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.11,1:45:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.72,1:46:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是 唔 薇奥莱特 对吧？ - 是我没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're, uh, Violet, right? - That's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.42,1:46:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回见 小薇 - 你看起来不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See you, Vi. - You look different.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.42,1:46:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得是不一样了 “不一样”好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel different. Is different okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.83,1:46:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,“不一样”么… “不一样”真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, different is... Different is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.13,1:46:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.44,1:46:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯？ - 你是不是想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Do you think maybe...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.14,1:46:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- …你和我… - 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...you and I... - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.14,1:46:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是不是… - 嘘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you... - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.54,1:46:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢看电影 我来买爆米花 怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like movies. I'll buy the popcorn. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.45,1:46:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看电影 听你的 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A movie. There you go. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.35,1:46:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 那么就在星期五？ - 星期五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, so Friday? - Friday.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.16,1:46:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上 达什 上 - 跑啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go, Dash, go. - Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.37,1:46:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 跑啊！加速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, run! Pick up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.87,1:46:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跑啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.27,1:46:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点 慢点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it, move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.67,1:46:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微慢一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pace it. Slow down just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.58,1:46:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别放弃啊 跟上去！ - 跑第二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Make it close! - Second.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.58,1:46:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,第二名 耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close second, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.49,1:46:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是我儿子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.89,1:46:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,达什 你真是太让我自豪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dash, I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.20,1:47:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我都搞不明白你到底要我干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know what the heck you wanted me to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.52,1:47:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看哪！我是钻地狂人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold the Underminer!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.02,1:47:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在你们下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am always beneath you,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.63,1:47:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可是没人在我下面！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but nothing is beneath me!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.23,1:47:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在对和平和幸福宣战！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hereby declare war on peace and happiness!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.24,1:47:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要不了多久 一切都会在我面前发抖！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon all will tremble before me!
